{
 "_about": "Vox / Johnny-Harris-style palettes in the calm printed-paper register of episodes 1-5 (creator preference): no neon, no harsh pairs. Themes are pre-validated (text >= 4.5:1, graphics >= 3:1). Rotated by episode number (studio.py look). Colours outside the palette (except black/white/greys) are flagged by studio.py check. Generated by build_palettes.py.",
 "rules": [
  "3-4 colours per scene: one background, one text colour, one highlight, one small pop colour",
  "flat colour blocks + real texture (paper, grain, halftone); no decorative gradients",
  "photos as cutouts with a thin paper outline and a soft shadow, or full-bleed with a colour wash",
  "hand-made marks: arrows, circles, underlines, strings, stamps, tape",
  "text only in the theme text colour; never accent-on-accent",
  "no top/bottom bars: background is one full-bleed colour, texture or photo"
